<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies four municipal bond issues.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies four municipal bond issues.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said on Thursday that it qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal bond issues set for competitive sale.</p>
<p>--West Deptford Township, N.J., school bonds, $8.880 million.</p>
<p>--Saranac Lake Central School District, N.Y., $4.320 million.</p>
<p>--Watervliet, N.Y., Public Improvment bonds, $1.886 million.</p>
<p>--Henderson County, Tenn., General Obligations, $12.16 million.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
